    "Bewerte einen Wein auf seiner Detailseite. Hier siehst du dann, was euch geschmeckt hat und was ihr wieder kaufen solltet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rate a wine on its detail page. Here you will then see what you liked and what you should buy again."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oceni vino na njegovoj stranici sa detaljima. Ovde ćeš onda videti šta vam se svidelo i šta bi trebalo ponovo kupiti."
          }
