            "value" : "Vinski savetnik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Wein-Berater braucht einen API-Key. Du findest das in den Einstellungen der App." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The wine advisor needs an API key. You can find this in the app’s settings."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vinskom savetniku je potreban API ključ. Pronađi to u podešavanjima aplikacije."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Wein-Berater und das Auslesen der Etiketten versuchen zuerst Apple. Die externe KI unten ist freiwillig und kommt nur zum Zug, wenn das nicht klappt." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The wine advisor and label reading try Apple first. The external AI below is optional and only steps in if that does not work."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vinski savetnik i očitavanje etiketa prvo pokušavaju sa Appleom. Spoljna VI ispod je dobrovoljna i na red dolazi samo ako to ne uspe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Weinkeller ist leer. Lege zuerst Flaschen an, damit ich etwas empfehlen kann." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
