            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Odgovor nije mogao da se pročita: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Antwort wurde abgeschnitten. Bitte erneut versuchen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The answer was cut off. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Odgovor je prekinut. Pokušaj ponovo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die App bleibt %@, unabhängig vom System." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app stays %@, regardless of the system."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikacija ostaje %@, nezavisno od sistema."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die App folgt der Einstellung von iOS." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app follows the iOS setting."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikacija prati podešavanje iOS-a."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die App kennt schon viele Weine. Beim Scannen und beim Tippen eines Namens schlägt sie passende Weine aus dem gemeinsamen Katalog vor. Bestätigst du einen, ergänzt sie fehlende Angaben und das Foto. Mit „Neue Weine vorschlagen“ in den Einstellungen hilfst du mit, den Katalog zu erweitern – nur Stammdaten und das Foto der Vorderseite, nie Notizen, Bewertungen oder Bestand." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app already knows many wines. When you scan and when you type a name, it suggests matching wines from the shared catalog. When you confirm one, it fills in missing details and the photo. With “Suggest new wines” in Settings you help expand the catalog – master data and the front photo only, never notes, ratings or stock."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikacija već poznaje mnoga vina. Pri skeniranju i pri kucanju naziva predlaže odgovarajuća vina iz zajedničkog kataloga. Kad jedno potvrdiš, dopunjuje podatke koji nedostaju i fotografiju. Opcijom „Predlaži nova vina“ u podešavanjima pomažeš da se katalog proširi – samo osnovni podaci i fotografija prednje strane, nikad beleške, ocene ni zaliha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die bisherigen Stimmen gehen verloren." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The votes so far will be lost."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dosadašnji glasovi se gube."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Einführung sind die Seiten vom ersten Start. Die Tipps sind die kleinen Hinweise am Ort – im Regal, beim Scannen, an der Liste –, die nach dem ersten Mal verschwinden." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The introduction is the pages from the first start. The tips are the small hints in context – in the rack, when scanning, on the list – that disappear after the first time."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uvod su stranice sa prvog pokretanja. Saveti su male napomene na licu mesta – na stalku, pri skeniranju, na listi – koje nestaju nakon prvog puta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Einreicher bekommen über den Entscheid eine Mitteilung." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contributors get a notification about the decision."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pošiljaoci dobijaju obaveštenje o odluci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Flasche einfach ganz fotografieren" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just photograph the whole bottle"
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jednostavno fotografiši celu flašu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Freigabe hat nicht geklappt. Bitte später erneut versuchen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sharing did not work. Please try again later."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deljenje nije uspelo. Pokušaj ponovo kasnije."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Freigabe ist gerade nicht möglich. Prüfe, ob du in iCloud angemeldet bist." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sharing is not possible right now. Check that you are signed in to iCloud."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deljenje trenutno nije moguće. Proveri da li si prijavljen u iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die ganze Party-Historie wird entfernt – auf allen Geräten. Der Bestand im Keller bleibt unberührt." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The whole party history will be removed – on all devices. The stock in the cellar stays untouched."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cela istorija žurki se uklanja – na svim uređajima. Zaliha u podrumu ostaje netaknuta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Gäste wählen, welche Flasche heute aufgeht. Das iPhone geht von Hand zu Hand." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guests choose which bottle gets opened today. The iPhone goes from hand to hand."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gosti biraju koja se flaša danas otvara. iPhone ide iz ruke u ruku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die gewählten Flaschen und die erfassten Gäste gehen verloren." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The chosen bottles and the guests you added will be lost."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Izabrane flaše i uneti gosti se gube."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die KI" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The AI"
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die KI hat zweimal keine brauchbare Empfehlung geliefert (Platzhalter oder unbekannte Weine). Bitte erneut versuchen oder das Gericht genauer beschreiben." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The AI twice gave no usable recommendation (placeholders or unknown wines). Please try again or describe the dish in more detail."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VI dvaput nije dala upotrebljivu preporuku (rezervisana mesta ili nepoznata vina). Pokušaj ponovo ili preciznije opiši jelo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Rolle „Admin“ wirkt in dieser Umgebung: Du darfst in den Katalog schreiben und Vorschläge entscheiden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The “Admin” role works in this environment: You may write to the catalog and decide on suggestions."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uloga „Admin“ važi u ovom okruženju: smeš da upisuješ u katalog i odlučuješ o predlozima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Siegerflasche" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The winning bottle"
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pobednička flaša"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Weinart wurde nicht erkannt – bitte wählen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The wine type was not recognized – please choose."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vrsta vina nije prepoznata – izaberi je."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Zahl nennt die Weine dieses Landes in der Liste." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The number shows the wines of this country in the list."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Broj pokazuje koliko vina te zemlje ima na listi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Zahl rechts sagt, wie viele Flaschen dieses Weins noch keinen Platz haben." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The number on the right shows how many bottles of this wine do not have a place yet."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Broj desno pokazuje koliko flaša ovog vina još nema mesto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese Flasche liegt in Fach %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This bottle is in slot %@."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ova flaša leži na mestu %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese Spanne stand auf dem Etikett." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This range was printed on the label."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ovaj raspon je pisao na etiketi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diesen Wein hast du schon" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You already have this wine"
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ovo vino već imaš"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dieser Anbieter ist aktiv." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This provider is active."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ovaj provajder je aktivan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drücke jetzt **dreimal die Seitentaste** und tippe auf „Starten“. Dann bleibt das Gerät auf dieser App, bis du es wieder freigibst – niemand kommt in andere Apps." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now press the **side button three times** and tap “Start”. The device then stays on this app until you release it – nobody can get into other apps."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sada **triput pritisni bočno dugme** i dodirni „Start“. Tada uređaj ostaje u ovoj aplikaciji dok ga ponovo ne otključaš – niko ne može u druge aplikacije."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du bist auf diesem Gerät nicht in iCloud angemeldet. Melde dich in den Systemeinstellungen an und versuch es erneut." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You are not signed in to iCloud on this device. Sign in in the system settings and try again."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na ovom uređaju nisi prijavljen u iCloud. Prijavi se u sistemskim podešavanjima i pokušaj ponovo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du hast mehrere Keys hinterlegt. Der bevorzugte wird für Empfehlungen verwendet. API-Keys liegen ausschliesslich in der Keychain dieses Geräts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You have stored several keys. The preferred one is used for recommendations. API keys are stored only in this device’s Keychain."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sačuvao si više ključeva. Za preporuke se koristi poželjni. API ključevi su isključivo u Keychain-u ovog uređaja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dunkel" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dark"
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tamna"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ebenen" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
