    "Name, Produzent, Jahrgang, Rebsorte, Region, Land, Weinart, Alkohol und das Foto der Vorderseite gehen zur Prüfung an den Betreiber der App. Notizen, Bewertungen, Bestand und Regal bleiben privat." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Name, producer, vintage, grape, region, country, wine type, alcohol and the front photo are sent to the app’s operator for review. Notes, ratings, stock and rack stay private."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Naziv, proizvođač, berba, sorta grožđa, region, zemlja, vrsta vina, alkohol i fotografija prednje etikete šalju se na proveru vlasniku aplikacije. Beleške, ocene, zalihe i police ostaju privatni."
